"┌ accounts ─────────────────────────────────┐"
"│ ● box  connected · pinned · then codex    │"
"│   Main  claude · claude-main · 4 sessions │"
"│     Session          42%                  │"
"│     ████████░░░░░░░░░░  resets in 2h 13m  │"
"│     Weekly           74%                  │"
"│     █████████████░░░░░  resets in 5d 3h   │"
"│     Weekly · Fable   93%                  │"
"│     █████████████████░  resets in 5d 3h   │"
"│   Work  claude · claude-work · failover   │"
"│     no usage reported yet                 │"
"│   codex  codex                            │"
"│     Session    8%                         │"
"│ ┌ add an account ───────────────────────┐ │"
"│ │                                       │ │"
"│ │ Runs the provider's own login on box, │ │"
"│ │                                       │ │"
"│ │   provider      claude   codex   curs │ │"
"│ │   id           e.g. work              │ │"
"│ │   label        the id                 │ │"
"│ │   config dir   ~/.claude-<id>         │ │"
"│ │                                       │ │"
"│ │ claude starts: log in with /login, th │ │"
"│ │ The account is added once the login s │ │"
"│ │                                       │ │"
"│ └ab field  ←→ provider  Esc cancel ─────┘ │"
"│                                           │"
"│                                           │"
"│                                           │"
"│                                           │"
"│                                           │"
"│ A session whose account hits a limit      │"
"│ moves to an account marked failover, of   │"
"│ its own provider, then of the providers   │"
"│ after "then", unless sessions are pinned. │"
"│ All are set in the machine's daemon       │"
"│ config (failover = true per account,      │"
"│ [failover] pin and providers).            │"
"└────── n add  r reconnect  Esc close ──────┘"
